<title>GREECE: GREEK GENER, ZEVS TO BUILD VOLOS FACTORY.</title>
<headline>GREEK GENER, ZEVS TO BUILD VOLOS FACTORY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The consortium of Greek construction firms, Gener and Zevs, will build the factory of a firm belonging to the Hellenic Bottling Company Group in Volos, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The construction of the factory has already started and will be completed in 1997, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
